{"id":"77058c5482c65c5c","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-thm-lusin.md","title":"Lusin's Theorem","display":"thm-lusin — Lusin's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-lusin","aliases":["58-thm-lusin"],"display":"thm-lusin — Lusin's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-lusin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-lusin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lusin — Lusin's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md\">../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\mu,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal L_E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\">\\(f,\\mu,\\mathcal L,\\mathcal L_E,\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md\">../batch17/58-df-continuous-function.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lusin} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\mu)\\land E\\in\\mathcal L\\land\\mu(E)&lt;\\infty\\land\n\\mathcal L_E=\\{A\\cap E:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(E,\\mathcal L_E,f)\n\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists K\\subseteq E\\;\\exists\\tau_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\tau_K=\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau_K)\\land\\mu(E\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon\\land\n\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(f\\upharpoonright K,K,\\tau_K,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lusin} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal L,\\mu)\\land E\\in\\mathcal L\\land\\mu(E)&lt;\\infty\\land\n\\mathcal L_E=\\{A\\cap E:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3RealMeasurableFunction}_S(E,\\mathcal L_E,f)\n\\to\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists K\\subseteq E\\;\\exists\\tau_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\tau_K=\\{U\\cap K:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\tau_K)\\land\\mu(E\\setminus K)&lt;\\varepsilon\\land\n\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(f\\upharpoonright K,K,\\tau_K,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> is the Euclidean subspace topology; existentially choosing an arbitrary compact topology would make the continuity conclusion degenerate.</li>\n<li>The measurable structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> is the explicitly defined trace sigma algebra rather than an unregistered restriction operator.</li>\n<li>Measurable sets are nearly open.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embe